[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0296","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48595","title":"elixir-tesla Tesla 跨源重定向授权标头泄漏漏洞","description":"Elixir 的 Tesla HTTP 客户端库中 `Tesla.Middleware.FollowRedirects` 中间件存在大小写处理不当漏洞。该中间件在跨源重定向时本应过滤掉 `Authorization` 等安全敏感标头，但过滤检查使用小写字符串 `\"authorization\"` 进行大小写敏感比较。由于 Tesla 保留调用者提供的原始标头键名（如 RFC 7235 规范大小写的 `\"Authorization\"`），导致该标头绕过过滤检查，在跨源重定向请求中泄露给第三方目标服务器。攻击者通过控制重定向目标即可窃取受害客户端的 Bearer 令牌等凭据。该漏洞影响 tesla 1.4.0 至 1.18.2 版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。已在 1.18.3 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48595","GHSA-9m9w-gxf7-rh8m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-02T20:16:38Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 tesla 至 1.18.3 或以上版本（`mix deps.update tesla`），该版本已修复大小写敏感比较问题。如无法立即升级，将所有 HTTP 请求头键名统一转为小写，使用 `\"authorization\"` 而非 `\"Authorization\"` 设置认证头，可通过 `Tesla.put_header/3` 或自定义中间件强制规范化头键名作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-48595.html","https://github.com/elixir-tesla/tesla/commit/db963dba67651b9abd1fc420a1d9679cf6efe182","https://github.com/elixir-tesla/tesla/security/advisories/GHSA-9m9w-gxf7-rh8m","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-48595","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-48595.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48595.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/6f55cdabfee7f424985cda0793a68247672d750d/2026/CVE-2026-48595.json","https://github.com/elixir-tesla/tesla/blob/dc56717827cf9cd65fca4f331520a9bae02fd544/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-48595.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-48595.md","https://github.com/erlef-cna/website/blob/c3ea8d6de083cd441e9c6143037548522b280a02/_data/osv/EEF-CVE-2026-48595.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/851fe3e699242718aa7a88e53b3fb00152c89428/posts/cve-2026-48595-erlang-tesla.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9m9w-gxf7-rh8m/GHSA-9m9w-gxf7-rh8m.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48595.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0295","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48594","title":"elixir-tesla Tesla 解压炸弹拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Elixir HTTP 客户端库 Tesla 的中间件 `Tesla.Middleware.DecompressResponse` 和 `Tesla.Middleware.Compression` 在处理 HTTP 响应体时存在解压炸弹漏洞。`decompress_body/2` 函数在解压响应体时未对输出大小做任何限制，且 `content-encoding` 头支持逗号分隔的多层编码令牌，每层 gzip 解压可膨胀约 1000 倍。攻击者通过控制目标客户端访问的恶意服务器（或利用重定向），返回一个仅数百字节但经过多层 gzip 嵌套压缩的响应，可膨胀至数 GB 的 BEAM 堆内存，导致调用进程内存耗尽崩溃或节点不可用。该漏洞影响 tesla 0.6.0 至 1.18.2 版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。已在 tesla 1.18.3 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48594","GHSA-mc85-72gr-vm9f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-02T20:16:38Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 tesla 升级至 1.18.3 或更高版本（`mix deps.update tesla`），该版本在 decompress_body/2 中增加了输出大小上限检查。如无法立即升级，请从中间件管道中移除 Tesla.Middleware.DecompressResponse 和 Tesla.Middleware.Compression，或通过反向代理（如 nginx）在进入应用前解压并限制响应体大小。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-48594.html","https://github.com/elixir-tesla/tesla/commit/340f75b5d191dc747ef7ac6365bd002d1cd55a9d","https://github.com/elixir-tesla/tesla/security/advisories/GHSA-mc85-72gr-vm9f","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-48594","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-48594.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48594.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48594.json","https://github.com/elixir-tesla/tesla/blob/dc56717827cf9cd65fca4f331520a9bae02fd544/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-48594.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-48594.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/erlef-cna/website/blob/c3ea8d6de083cd441e9c6143037548522b280a02/_data/osv/EEF-CVE-2026-48594.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/ad2bcc66bdd6cd816d33b50c6a2002801f870705/posts/cve-2026-48594-erlang-tesla.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-48594.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0295.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0528","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24237","title":"NVIDIA NVTabular 不安全反序列化漏洞","description":"NVIDIA NVTabular 存在不安全的反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），攻击者可通过向受影响系统提交特制的序列化数据触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行、数据篡改及信息泄露。该漏洞影响 NVIDIA NVTabular 产品，攻击者需具备本地访问权限及低权限条件方可利用，无需用户交互。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。建议用户及时关注 NVIDIA 官方安全公告并升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24237"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-02T17:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 NVIDIA NVTabular 更新至 GitHub 仓库 NVIDIA-Merlin/NVTabular 的 commit 08e0633（对应 2026-03-12 之后版本），可通过 `git pull && git checkout 08e0633` 升级。由于该漏洞源于不安全反序列化（CWE-502），如无法立即更新，应限制本地用户对 NVTabular 数据加载接口的访问权限，并避免加载不可信的序列化数据文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24237","https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5851","https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-24237","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24237.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24237.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-24237.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-24237.md","https://github.com/NVIDIA/product-security/blob/87cba624878101147040549f75f4b9bb6b69df37/2026/5851/5851.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-g694-w46x-9wjv/GHSA-g694-w46x-9wjv.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24237.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/9b024cb6afc9cf503e936fc8ef427558af66d85a/api/stats.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/9a8a5da65a1458854219fa63b08ed65dbe98d334/CNAReports/nvidia.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-24237.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0317","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49754","title":"elixir-mint Mint HTTP/2 CONTINUATION 泛洪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mint HTTP/2 客户端在处理 HEADERS 帧时存在无限制资源累积漏洞。当客户端收到未设置 END_HEADERS 标志的 HEADERS 帧后，后续的 CONTINUATION 帧数据会被无上限地追加到连接级缓冲区中，且未对帧数量或总大小设置任何限制。远程未认证攻击者可通过控制恶意 HTTP/2 服务器向目标客户端持续发送 CONTINUATION 帧，导致客户端内存被耗尽，进而造成 BEAM 进程崩溃（拒绝服务）。仅需建立单条连接即可触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 Mint 0.1.0 至 1.9.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49754","GHSA-2p26-p43x-fhp8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-02T16:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"升级 Mint 至 1.9.0 或更高版本（`mix deps.update mint`），该版本已限制 HTTP/2 CONTINUATION 帧累积大小。如无法立即升级，在连接不可信服务器时传入 `protocols: [:http1]` 选项强制使用 HTTP/1.1 以规避漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-49754.html","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/commit/b662d127d3028b5426c88d4c9cc7fe430491a10b","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/security/advisories/GHSA-2p26-p43x-fhp8","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-49754","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-49754.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49754.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49754.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49754.md","https://github.com/elixir-explorer/explorer/blob/d8412e82516d0d204ae2a687d04c04324414ec7d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49754.md","https://github.com/erlef-cna/website/blob/c3ea8d6de083cd441e9c6143037548522b280a02/_data/osv/EEF-CVE-2026-49754.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3f9f364bccc73ba3de8be88b66bacb6688594e5b/posts/cve-2026-49754-erlang-mint.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-2p26-p43x-fhp8/GHSA-2p26-p43x-fhp8.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/69057bcb6031b1cea28108d52631b2209d46077a/data/2026/CVE-2026-49754.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0316","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0316.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49753","title":"elixir-mint Mint HTTP/1 客户端 HTTP 响应走私漏洞","description":"Mint HTTP/1 客户端在解析 Content-Length 响应头时，使用 Integer.parse/1 函数处理头部值，该函数允许可选的 \"+\" 或 \"-\" 符号前缀。虽然长度 ≥0 的检查排除了负数，但 \"+0\"、\"+123\" 等输入仍被当作有效长度值处理，违反了 RFC 7230 规定的 Content-Length 必须为纯数字的规范。当客户端通过严格遵守 RFC 的前置代理或负载均衡器复用连接时，代理与 Mint 对响应帧的解析不一致，导致响应走私攻击：攻击者控制的恶意上游服务器可在共享连接上向其他消费者的响应流中注入数据。该漏洞影响 Mint 0.1.0 至 1.9.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。官方已在 1.9.0 版本中通过修复 Content-Length 解析逻辑完成修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49753","GHSA-mjqx-c6f6-7rc2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-02T16:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Mint 升级至 1.9.0 或更高版本（`mix deps.update mint`），该版本已修复 Content-Length 解析器对 `+` 前缀的宽松处理。如无法升级，可在上游代理/负载均衡层配置规则拒绝 `Content-Length` 值含非数字字符的请求，并避免跨信任域复用同一 Mint 连接池。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-49753.html","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/commit/47e48027480228e4e32a0b4df39db497b4804921","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/security/advisories/GHSA-mjqx-c6f6-7rc2","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-49753","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-49753.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49753.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49753.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49753.md","https://github.com/elixir-explorer/explorer/blob/d8412e82516d0d204ae2a687d04c04324414ec7d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49753.md","https://github.com/erlef-cna/website/blob/c3ea8d6de083cd441e9c6143037548522b280a02/_data/osv/EEF-CVE-2026-49753.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-mjqx-c6f6-7rc2/GHSA-mjqx-c6f6-7rc2.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49753.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/c90ad5c96a79db358ddf823df4ed4f299d202d94/data/osv-hex.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0303","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48862","title":"elixir-mint Mint HTTP/2 客户端 PUSH_PROMISE 资源耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mint HTTP/2 客户端在处理 PUSH_PROMISE 帧时存在资源分配无限制漏洞。lib/mint/http2.ex 中的 decode_push_promise_headers_and_add_response/5 函数在收到服务端推送承诺帧后，直接将每个承诺的流 ID 插入 conn.streams 映射中，而未检查 max_concurrent_streams 并发限制。攻击者控制的恶意 HTTP/2 服务端可发送大量 PUSH_PROMISE 帧但不发送对应的响应 HEADERS 帧，导致每个承诺帧在客户端内存中永久占用约 148 字节的条目，最终耗尽客户端进程内存造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 mint 0.2.0 至 1.9.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。服务端推送默认开启，无需应用主动启用即可被利用。建议升级到 mint 1.9.0 或更高版本，或在连接到不可信服务端时设置 client_settings 中 enable_push 为 false 以禁用 HTTP/2 服务端推送功能。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48862","GHSA-g586-ccqf-7x4r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-02T16:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"将 Mint 升级至 1.9.0 或更高版本（含补丁 commit 70b97b6）。如无法立即升级，在连接不可信服务器时通过 `client_settings: [enable_push: false]` 禁用 HTTP/2 Server Push，Mint 将在 PUSH_PROMISE 到达时直接返回 PROTOCOL_ERROR 从而阻断攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-48862.html","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/commit/70b97b6a5209fb288b0e04d8e657dda26c59de67","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/security/advisories/GHSA-g586-ccqf-7x4r","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-48862","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-48862.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48862.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48862.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-48862.md","https://github.com/elixir-explorer/explorer/blob/d8412e82516d0d204ae2a687d04c04324414ec7d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-48862.md","https://github.com/erlef-cna/website/blob/c3ea8d6de083cd441e9c6143037548522b280a02/_data/osv/EEF-CVE-2026-48862.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9542f124dc2666bd5faef7b9364f9b770a02f8f0/posts/cve-2026-48862-erlang-mint.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-g586-ccqf-7x4r/GHSA-g586-ccqf-7x4r.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/b36aad80af9d4885d28bae2d9125e8d29ed3f3c1/data/2026/CVE-2026-48862.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0302","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48861","title":"elixir-mint Mint HTTP请求行CRLF注入漏洞","description":"Elixir Mint HTTP/1 客户端库的请求行编码函数 `encode_request_line/2` 未对调用者传入的 `method` 和 `target` 参数进行字符校验，直接将用户可控输入拼接至 HTTP/1 请求行中。攻击者可通过在 `method` 字段中注入 CRLF 控制字符提前终止请求行，进而注入任意 HTTP 请求头或通过管道技术（HTTP pipelining）在同一个 TCP 连接中走私完全由攻击者控制的第二个 HTTP 请求。该漏洞影响 Mint 0.1.0 至 1.9.0 之前的所有版本，当应用程序将用户可控输入作为 HTTP method 参数传递给 `Mint.HTTP.request/5` 时即可被利用，可能导致请求头伪造、缓存投毒或越权访问后端接口。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48861","GHSA-2pg6-44cx-c49v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-02T16:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-22T19:10:00Z","remediation":"升级 Mint 至 1.9.0 或以上版本（`mix deps.update mint`），该版本已对 method 字段进行 CRLF 字符校验。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对传入 Mint.HTTP.request/5 的 method 参数做严格校验，拒绝包含 `\\r` 或 `\\n` 的输入，并启用 `validate_request_target/2` 的默认校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-48861.html","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/commit/fad091454cbb7449b19edb8e1fee12ca7cf28c3a","https://github.com/elixir-mint/mint/security/advisories/GHSA-2pg6-44cx-c49v","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-48861","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-48861.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48861.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48861.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-48861.md","https://github.com/elixir-explorer/explorer/blob/d8412e82516d0d204ae2a687d04c04324414ec7d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/type/req-smuggling.txt","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-48861.md","https://github.com/erlef-cna/website/blob/c3ea8d6de083cd441e9c6143037548522b280a02/_data/osv/EEF-CVE-2026-48861.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-2pg6-44cx-c49v/GHSA-2pg6-44cx-c49v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-48861.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0123","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-8206","title":"Kirki WordPress 插件账户接管漏洞","description":"WordPress Kirki 插件（Freeform Page Builder、Website Builder & Customizer）在 6.0.0 至 6.0.6 版本中存在权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于密码重置功能在处理用户名时未验证邮箱地址归属，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用任意邮箱地址接收目标用户的密码重置链接，从而实现账户接管，获取网站管理员权限。攻击无需任何前置条件，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议升级至 6.0.7 及以上版本或完全卸载该插件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-8206"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-02T04:17:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T11:03:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kirki Framework 至 6.0.7 或更高版本（若已停止使用则彻底卸载该插件）。临时缓解措施：在主题 functions.php 中添加 `add_filter('wp_ajax_kirki_ajax', '__return_false');` 禁用漏洞相关的 AJAX 处理，并审计现有用户账号，移除可疑未授权账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/kirki/tags/6.0.4/ComponentLibrary/controller/CompLibFormHandler.php#L330","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/kirki/tags/6.0.4/ComponentLibrary/controller/CompLibFormHandler.php#L48","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/kirki/tags/6.0.4/ComponentLibrary/controller/ElementGenerator.php#L227","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/kirki/trunk/ComponentLibrary/controller/CompLibFormHandler.php#L330","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/kirki/trunk/ComponentLibrary/controller/CompLibFormHandler.php#L48","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/kirki/trunk/ComponentLibrary/controller/ElementGenerator.php#L227","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/3530843/kirki","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/3b5630bd-5bce-4226-959f-5e81ae69b799?source=cve","https://github.com/amnsecurity/CVE-2026-8206-Kirki-WP","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-8206.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-8206-kirki-3b5630bd-5bce-4226-959f-5e81ae69b799.yaml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-8206.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-02/TIER_1_CVE-2026-8206.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/8xxx/CVE-2026-8206.json","https://github.com/nahamsec/wp-cve-intel/blob/c754020fc287b1c3e8d17e86090949242dc3b34a/2026/CVE-2026-8206/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-8206.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/78453fda61545f56ec9c1e2f8e5aa78adf2aa3c6/app/routes/posts/2026-06-02_CVE-2026-8206.mdx","https://github.com/izxci/CVE-2026-8206/blob/b432bb15865966334d842c8aeb90be1c9609f2f0/CVE-2026-8206.py","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/7b89d2ad9b6f9791176edac77d8aa3a8095e8b9d/cve/CVE-2026-8206.html","https://github.com/Jenderal92/CVE-2026-8206","https://github.com/izxci/CVE-2026-8206","https://github.com/rootdirective-sec/CVE-2026-8206-Lab","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8206"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0123.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0123.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0125","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-8732","title":"WordPress WP Maps Pro 插件权限提升漏洞","description":"WordPress WP Maps Pro 插件存在权限提升漏洞，该漏洞源于 `wpgmp_temp_access_ajax` AJAX 动作通过 `wp_ajax_nopriv_` 向未认证用户开放，其唯一保护机制是依靠前端页面通过 `wp_localize_script` 公开嵌入的 `fc-call-nonce` nonce 值进行校验，导致访问控制完全失效。未认证攻击者可利用此缺陷直接调用 `wpgmp_temp_access_support` 处理器并设置 `check_temp=false`，插件会无条件调用 `wp_insert_user()` 创建一个具有管理员角色的用户账号并返回魔法登录链接，攻击者访问该链接后自动通过 `wp_set_auth_cookie()` 完成认证，实现对目标 WordPress 网站的完全接管。该漏洞影响 WP Maps Pro 6.1.0 及以下所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-8732"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-29T07:16:14Z","updated":"2026-07-21T12:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 WP Maps Pro 插件升级至 6.1.1 或更高版本。如尚无官方补丁，在 wp-config.php 中添加 define('DISALLOW_FILE_EDIT', true) 并禁用未认证用户注册功能。临时缓解措施可删除或注释掉 wp_ajax_nopriv_wpgmp_temp_access_ajax 的注册代码，阻止未认证用户访问该 AJAX 接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://codecanyon.net/item/advanced-google-maps-plugin-for-wordpress/5211638","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/65988550-d39d-40be-8d25-647e7237062d?source=cve","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-8732.yaml","https://github.com/Diznev/CVE-2026-8732-EXPLOIT","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-8732.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9426659ffb94439885c8f9a7072893bb232e3620/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-8732.yaml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-8732.md","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-8732-wp_google_map_gold-65988550-d39d-40be-8d25-647e7237062d.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/8xxx/CVE-2026-8732.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-8732/README.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/fd89cc2cfe78c9fb7c61a5f098d9b2b1a9