标用户的 Firebase 身份凭证即可伪装认证。已认证的攻击者（拥有订阅者及以上权限）可向 `acb_firebase_auth` AJAX 接口提交任意已存在用户的邮箱地址，从而实现账户接管，包括管理员账户。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-8787"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-27T07:16:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T11:04:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 WordPress Firebase Support & Chat Management 插件至 3.1.1 以上版本。检查 `acb_firebase_auth` AJAX 函数中对 Firebase ID Token 的签名、颁发者、受众验证逻辑是否完整，确保 `user_email` 参数不可直接用于身份认证。如无法升级，临时禁用该 AJAX 动作或移除 `firebase_auth()` 函数中的邮箱直传逻辑作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/tags/3.1.1/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L237","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/tags/3.1.1/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L338","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/trunk/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L237","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/trunk/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L338","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/90783d75-a255-4133-ac7b-32e0a70c8c69?source=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/8xxx/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-8787-admin_chat_box-90783d75-a255-4133-ac7b-32e0a70c8c69.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d40439944a245bd3d15d0e2034784cb651a6b55/2026/8xxx/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/644985d2f6944ebfc351d3a58af338c527c434cf/content/posts/cve-2026-8787.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-8787.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-g86w-5353-83r2/GHSA-g86w-5353-83r2.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_Firebase_Support_and_Chat_Management_%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-8787.toml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2026-8787-admin_chat_box-90783d75-a255-4133-ac7b-32e0a70c8c69.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8787"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0525","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24162","title":"NVIDIA Transformers4Rec 不安全反序列化漏洞","description":"NVIDIA Transformers4Rec for Linux 存在不安全的反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），攻击者通过向目标系统提交特制的恶意序列化数据，触发 Transformers4Rec 组件在反序列化过程中执行未预期的代码。该漏洞可能导致远程代码执行、数据篡改及敏感信息泄露。攻击需要用户交互（如诱导用户加载恶意文件），且攻击者需具备本地访问能力，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 NVIDIA 官方发布的安全修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24162"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-26T17:16:29Z","updated":"2026-07-24T11:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 NVIDIA Transformers4Rec 至最新修复版本，具体更新包请访问 NVIDIA 官方安全公告页面（PSIRT Bulletin 5838: https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5838）下载。如无法立即升级，应避免加载不可信来源的模型文件，并在应用层面对序列化数据进行严格的输入验证和反序列化白名单过滤，以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24162","https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5838","https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-24162","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24162.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/nvidia-psirt/CVE-2026-24162.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24162.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-24162.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-24162.md","https://github.com/NVIDIA/product-security/blob/87cba624878101147040549f75f4b9bb6b69df37/2026/5838/5838.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-xh7m-p996-h2f6/GHSA-xh7m-p996-h2f6.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24162.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-05-29_12-21-15.md","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/9a8a5da65a1458854219fa63b08ed65dbe98d334/CNAReports/nvidia.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0081","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-4480","title":"Samba 打印子系统远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 打印子系统中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。在配置了 print command 参数时，Samba 将客户端可控的打印作业描述（job description）字符串通过 %J 替换符传递给 shell 命令，而未对 shell 元字符进行转义过滤。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过提交特制的打印作业描述，在目标服务器上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Samba 4.20.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-4480"],"sources":["cve","hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Samba 4.20.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 %J 参数未转义 shell 元字符的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中禁用打印服务（load printers = no、printing = bsd），或在防火墙层面限制 445/tcp 端口的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","reference