t/ansible-mitigate-copyfail-dirtyfrag","https://github.com/azilRababe/CVE-2026-46300","https://github.com/Koshmare-Blossom/Fragnesia-go","https://github.com/cumakurt/linuxpi","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-46300"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0082","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45659","title":"Microsoft SharePoint 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 存在不受信任数据反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），经过身份认证的攻击者可通过网络向目标 SharePoint 端点发送特制的反序列化 payload（可利用 ysoserial.net 等工具生成），触发漏洞后导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016、SharePoint Server 2019 及 SharePoint Server Subscription Edition，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，Microsoft 已在 2026 年 6 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45659"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-22T23:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-02T12:16:47Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2026 年对应月份 SharePoint 安全更新（参阅 MSRC 公告），该更新将修复 SharePoint 中的反序列化漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层配置规则拦截包含 ysoserial.net 特征的反序列化攻击载荷，并限制经身份验证用户上传包含序列化数据的文件类型。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-45659","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-45659","https://github.com/amnsecurity/CVE-2026-45659-SharePoint-RCE","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-45659.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2026/CVE-2026-45659.yaml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-45659.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45659.json","https://github.